def get_slide_data() -> dict:
    return {
        'title': 'Variable Reference',
        'content': '\n# Variable Reference Glossary\n\nA consolidated reference of all variables used across DSMC simulation, aerodynamics, aerothermodynamics, and survivability optimization.\n\n---\n\n## 1. DSMC / Rarefied Gas Variables\n\n| Symbol | Description | Units |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| $\\lambda$ | Mean free path | $\\text{m}$ |\n| $d$ | Molecular diameter | $\\text{m}$ |\n| $n$ | Number density | $\\text{m}^{-3}$ |\n| $Kn$ | Knudsen number | dimensionless |\n| $L$ | Characteristic length | $\\text{m}$ |\n| $\\sigma$ | Collision cross-section | $\\text{m}^2$ |\n| $g$ | Relative velocity of colliding molecules | $\\text{m/s}$ |\n| $\\omega$ | Viscosity index (gas-specific) | dimensionless |\n\nMean free path: $\\displaystyle\\lambda = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}\\,\\pi\\,d^2\\,n}$\n\n---\n\n## 2. Aerodynamics & Flight Metrics\n\nImplemented in `calculate_flight_metrics` to derive performance from SPARTA surface results.\n\n$$\\rho = n_{\\rho} \\cdot \\frac{M_{\\text{air}}}{N_A}, \\qquad q = \\tfrac{1}{2}\\rho v_\\infty^2, \\qquad \\beta = \\frac{m \\cdot q}{F_{\\text{drag}}}, \\qquad n = \\frac{F_{\\text{drag}}}{m \\cdot g_0}$$\n\n| Symbol | Description | Units |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| $\\rho$ | Mass density | $\\text{kg/m}^3$ |\n| $n_\\rho$ | Number density | $\\text{m}^{-3}$ |\n| $M_{\\text{air}}$ | Molar mass of air ($\\approx 28.97\\text{ g/mol}$) | $\\text{kg/mol}$ |\n| $N_A$ | Avogadro\'s constant ($6.022\\times10^{23}\\text{ mol}^{-1}$) | $\\text{mol}^{-1}$ |\n| $q$ | Dynamic pressure | $\\text{Pa}$ |\n| $v_\\infty$ | Freestream velocity | $\\text{m/s}$ |\n| $\\beta$ | Ballistic coefficient | $\\text{kg/m}^2$ |\n| $m$ | Vehicle mass | $\\text{kg}$ |\n| $F_{\\text{drag}}$ | Drag force | $\\text{N}$ |\n| $n$ | Deceleration in Earth gravities | $g\'\\text{s}$ |\n| $g_0$ | Standard gravity | $9.81\\text{ m/s}^2$ |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Aerothermodynamics & Thermal Protection (TPS)\n\nEstimates for the flexible TPS stack (LOFTID/IRVE-3 F-TPS) — Lau et al., 2013 / Lippincott et al., 2019.\n\n$$\\dot{q} = \\frac{Q_{\\text{total}}}{A_{\\text{ref}}}, \\qquad T_{\\text{surface}} = \\left(\\frac{\\dot{q}}{\\sigma\\,\\epsilon}\\right)^{1/4}, \\qquad T_{\\text{back}} = T_{\\text{init}} + \\frac{\\dot{q}\\cdot\\Delta t\\cdot\\eta_{\\text{lag}}}{\\rho_{\\text{TPS}}\\cdot C_{p,\\text{TPS}}\\cdot\\delta_{\\text{TPS}}}$$\n\n| Symbol | Description | Units |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| $\\dot{q}$ | Surface heat flux | $\\text{W/m}^2$ |\n| $Q_{\\text{total}}$ | Total heat rate | $\\text{W}$ |\n| $A_{\\text{ref}}$ | Reference area | $\\text{m}^2$ |\n| $T_{\\text{surface}}$ | Radiative equilibrium surface temperature | $\\text{K}$ |\n| $\\sigma$ | Stefan-Boltzmann constant ($5.67\\times10^{-8}\\text{ W/m}^2\\text{K}^4$) | $\\text{W/m}^2\\text{K}^4$ |\n| $\\epsilon$ | Emissivity | dimensionless |\n| $T_{\\text{back}}$ | Payload/Backface temperature | $\\text{K}$ |\n| $\\Delta t$ | Heat pulse duration | $\\text{s}$ |\n| $\\eta_{\\text{lag}}$ | Thermal lag efficiency (typically $0.15$) | dimensionless |\n| $\\rho_{\\text{TPS}}$ | TPS density | $\\text{kg/m}^3$ |\n| $C_{p,\\text{TPS}}$ | TPS specific heat | $\\text{J/kg}{\\cdot}\\text{K}$ |\n| $\\delta_{\\text{TPS}}$ | TPS thickness | $\\text{m}$ |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Survivability Optimization (SBO)\n\nThe Genetic Algorithm (GA) optimizes HIAD geometry using a Metamodel Prognosis (MoP).\n\n$$J = w_\\beta\\!\\left(\\frac{\\beta_{\\text{calc}} - \\beta_{\\text{target}}}{10}\\right)^{\\!2} + w_{\\text{target}}\\!\\left(\\frac{y_{\\text{pred}} - y_{\\text{target}}}{1}\\right)^{\\!2}$$\n\nLHS Sampling (McKay et al., 1979): $\\displaystyle x_i = x_{\\min} + (x_{\\max} - x_{\\min})\\cdot\\frac{i + r}{N}$\n\n| Symbol | Description | Units |\n| :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| $J$ | Optimization cost value | dimensionless |\n| $w_\\beta,\\,w_{\\text{target}}$ | Weight coefficients | dimensionless |\n| $\\beta_{\\text{calc}}$ | Derived ballistic coefficient | $\\text{kg/m}^2$ |\n| $y_{\\text{pred}}$ | Metamodel prediction | — |\n| $x_i$ | Sample value for parameter $x$ | — |\n| $r$ | Random number $\\in [0,1)$ | dimensionless |\n| $N$ | Total samples | dimensionless |\n\n<div style="margin-top: 2rem; display:flex; gap:1rem; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:flex-end;">\n    <a href="#" class="back-btn" style="margin-bottom:0; background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15); border-color:rgba(99,102,241,0.3); color:#a5b4fc;" onclick="loadTheoremSlide(7)">&larr; Rarefied Gas Dynamics</a>\n    <a href="#" class="back-btn" style="margin-bottom:0; background:rgba(16,185,129,0.15); border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.3); color:#6ee7b7;" onclick="loadTheoremSlide(3)">Boltzmann Kinetic Theory &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n'
    }
